  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Redefinition of infectious disease surveillance system governance and strengthening of institutional foundation, Advancement of digital infrastructure for infectious disease surveillance and establishment of information systems, Capacity building for the implementation of AI based intelligent prediction and early warning, Capacity building for field centered epidemiological investigators and response personnel utilizing the smart surveillance system</narrative>
